@direction LR
@spacing 60

[List Every Active Workflow in the Account] -> [Define Each Workflow's Input and Expected Output]
[Define Each Workflow's Input and Expected Output] -> [Trace What Each Workflow Actually Does, Step by Step]
[Trace What Each Workflow Actually Does, Step by Step] -> [Compare Actual Output Against Expected Output]
[Compare Actual Output Against Expected Output] -> [Measure Efficiency: Step Count, Delay Time, Drop-Off Points]
[Measure Efficiency: Step Count, Delay Time, Drop-Off Points] -> [Log Every Gap Found, With Its Root Cause]
[Log Every Gap Found, With Its Root Cause] -> [Sort Every Logged Gap by Lead-Flow Impact]
[Sort Every Logged Gap by Lead-Flow Impact] -> [Assign Each Gap a Fix: Quick Fix or Rebuild]
[Assign Each Gap a Fix: Quick Fix or Rebuild] -> [Compile Into One Prioritized List]
[Compile Into One Prioritized List] -> [Walk the Client Through Findings and Fixes]
